-- the sites in stream.b, and how many shapes reach each
   10x ChunkReader.refuse / the one funnel every reader refusal goes through
   1x chunk / ID is not a slot this page left open
   1x chunk / the chunk for ID carries chunk framing of its own
   1x chunk / the chunk for ID was written after the document ended
   1x chunk / the chunk for ID was written before the page's head
   1x chunk / the slot ID was filled twice
   1x close / a streamed page was closed before it was opened
   1x emit / a fault the serializer raised on the region's frames
   1x emit / the region ID is no longer a StreamRegion
   1x gone / the region ID is no longer mounted
   2x head / ID is not a usable slot id
   1x head / a streamed document has one head
   1x head / the page's head carries chunk framing of its own
   1x head / the slot ID is promised twice by one page
   1x open / @stream but no StreamRegion
   1x open / N streamed region(s) but no @stream
   1x open / a streamed page is opened once
   1x open / the region named X cannot be a slot id
   1x open / two regions on this page are both named X
   1x resolve / ID is not a region of this page
   1x tail / a streamed document ended before it had a head
   1x tail / a streamed document ends once
   1x tail / the document ended with N slot(s) never filled
   1x tail / the page's tail carries chunk framing of its own
